Package: m6APrediction
Title: Predict m6A RNA Modification Sites Using Random Forest
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Tiancheng", "Liu", email = "Tiancheng.Liu24@student.xjtlu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R package for predicting N6-methyladenosine (m6A) RNA modification sites using random forest models. Provides functions for DNA sequence encoding, multiple-sample prediction, and single-sample prediction with probability output.
